   ☾ Arthur: He dreamt that he was balancing the ledger in the great ledger-room at Moorgate, and making it right.
   ☾ Mr. Thomas (forgotten by morning): He dreamt that he was promoted to be chief cashier, and that Arthur Hale was made chief clerk.

